{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p></p>\n<p>去中亞旅行想玩得盡興又不想花大錢？吉爾吉斯這個兩日一夜的隱藏版行程絕對是戶外迷的首選！只需約600港元，就能坐上前蘇聯越野大卡車，一路顛簸深入海拔三千多米的高山草原。雖然車程像坐過山車般刺激，但沿途絕美的湖泊和雪山風景絕對值回票價。\n</p>\n<br/>\n上山後，你可以自由選擇騎馬、徒步健行，甚至泡天然溫泉，完全沉浸在大自然中。玩累了也不用擔心挨凍，行程貼心安排了有暖氣的室內蒙古包，晚上還能跟團友圍著營火跳舞看星星，完美平衡極限探險與舒適休息。\n<p>留言「Let’s go」即刻send旅行團資料俾你🇰🇬</p>\n<p>好動旅人 ｜ 旅遊不止食買玩，用跑步、潛水或滑雪等活動探索世界，在運動的節奏裡，發現每個地方最真實的風景。邊一場戶外旅程令你最難忘？即刻DM我哋分享你的冒險故事！</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.gotrip.hk/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179368566384177657_13264036436ae978a1c6a16.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"478\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.gotrip.hk/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179368566384177657_13264036436ae978a1c6a16.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>(圖片來源：@goden._.ally)</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<blockquote><p>在 Instagram 查看這則貼文<a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/reel/DfQ_lJMzS0V/?utm_source=ig_embed&amp;utm_campaign=loading\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">新假期 Weekend Weekly（@weekendweekly）分享的貼文</a></p></blockquote>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p>\n<i></i>\nTags :\n<a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/ig%e7%b2%be%e9%81%b8/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">IG精選</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e4%b8%ad%e4%ba%9e%e6%97%85%e9%81%8a/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">中亞旅遊</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e5%90%89%e7%88%be%e5%90%89%e6%96%af/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">吉爾吉斯</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e8%b6%8a%e9%87%8e%e6%8e%a2%e9%9a%aa/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">越野探險</a> </p>\n<p>\n<i></i>\n<p>\n圖片來源：@goden._.ally資料或影片來源：<a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/reel/DfQ_lJMzS0V/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Gotrip IG</a>\n</p>\n</p><p></p>\n<a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/category/%e7%94%9f%e6%b4%bb/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">生活</a>\nNov 3 2026\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<p></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-03T06:22:46.251868+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":481,"images":1,"source":"GoTrip","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-03T06:01:08+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-03T06:18:59.593286+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-03T06:18:59.593286+00:00","content_hash":"b51bddb8f822affbea0e1bff54b64ee4bf8b02fbccda1a286ff48ae2e1955891","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}